[#D7D7AF][/dim]trailing-ledger-section preservation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]snooze_wake_engine.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/snooze_wake_engine.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/snoozed_tasks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-q5.1.1[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-q5/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob-cli-q5.1.1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Snooze row, clock, and resolved-state contracts[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]row-model[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]row-model: build src/native/snooze parsing, injected zoned time grammar,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolved row classification, and live_targets reader API. Establish [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/snooze.md and shared rows/when/live vectors with concrete schemas [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for all six vector groups. Reserve Snoozed as a structural H2. Follow [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the row-model section and inherited decisions; leave mutation, CLI, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reader integrations to their owners. Run focused conformance tests and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]applicable repository gates.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pure add, drop, and never-running wake planners[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mutation-planners[dim] · [dim][/dim]after row-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mutation-planners: implement pure add/drop/wake plans, identity-based [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]subtree moves, row deduplication and history, and opt-in never-running [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]placement without changing ordinary link placement. Finish [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snooze/wake/cleanup vectors, preserve notes and recorded time, and prove[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task lines never change on wake. Export reusable planners for the outer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]epic's capture phase.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Public snooze CLI and guarded write shell[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]guarded-cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mutation-planners[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]guarded-cli: register bob snooze list/add/drop/wake and the read-only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bare default, JSON and human output, completion and command-catalog [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]entries. Add the bounded vault-lock/replan/preimage shell, multi-file [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add transaction, writer-host pin, dry-run behavior, and day rollover [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]checks. Verify races, refusals, forecasts, and repeated wakes. Generate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CLI references.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Wake receipts, notification arbitration, and first tick step[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wake-delivery[dim] · [dim][/dim]after guarded-cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wake-delivery: add post-commit wake receipts, Darwin notification, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snooze.notify config, live notifier-claim arbitration and truthful [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]desktop fallback reporting. Register snooze first in tick with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]five-minute cadence, readiness gate, two-minute ceiling and nonfailure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deferred/skipped handling. Test receipt ordering and notification [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failures with fakes; update tick/config docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Trailing-section writer audit and complete wake-engine [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]verification[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]writer-audit[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wake-delivery[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer-audit: audit Rust ledger writers against a trailing Snoozed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section, adding byte-preservation regressions for capture [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]link/start/close/record/lineup, gcal insertion/filing, reconcile, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]collect_done target repair. Fix boundary leaks, complete docs and vector[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coverage, and run just check and just docs-check. Provide closure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]evidence to this child epic's land agent; do not close bob-cli-q5.1 or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-q5 from this child phase.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-q5.1.1","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-q5.1.1.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-85161b621674c94ec42424192f3cf2e7","started_at":"2026-11-25T15:39:21.121674+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"5383019928fac817687e481b228b5b68ef031057f0b8623b48f48fa162e7e11b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q5.7/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"216a3d3e91d43f7efac93d57185e3b73561e11d5df6cab98b5223fc71428f443","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q5.7/meta.json","size_bytes":704},"prompt":{"digest":"d24e6a68f9834aa24b19ff30550826cbf16f8364883bc57b5464923dbda5f24c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q5.7/prompt.md","size_bytes":216},"state":{"digest":"51298e45ce4090a874050af436fa0e4d88c674947aa13b5f83dc0923105ebe2f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q5